    "description": "Live: fa #1227 (ai-teammate, gh-1096). pr_approved + ai_pr_reviewed + MERGEABLE, parked on validation_failed from the CI-storm era — and NO SM path clears it: park-reset requires a NON-machine substantive push newer than the park (never happens for machine PRs — fa pushes their heads), and rework armers list validation_failed as an in-flight blocker (review-threads rule line ~489) so no rework leg fires either. Owner directive 2026-10-05: 'SM должен снимать validation_failed сам в таком случае'.

