Also note silent-update-behind's contract says 'Machine-authored PRs never get the label' — yet #1227 carries it (legacy residue the #730 sweep missed, or a second labeling path exists). Verify BOTH: (a) no current rule labels machine PRs validation_failed; (b) a self-clear path exists.

