    "description": "Live: fa #1227 (ai-teammate, gh-1096). pr_approved + ai_pr_reviewed + MERGEABLE, parked on validation_failed from the CI-storm era — and NO SM path clears it: park-reset requires a NON-machine substantive push newer than the park (never happens for machine PRs — fa pushes their heads), and rework armers list validation_failed as an in-flight blocker (review-threads rule line ~489) so no rework leg fires either. Owner directive 2026-10-05: 'SM должен снимать validation_failed сам в таком случае'.

Also note silent-update-behind's contract says 'Machine-authored PRs never get the label' — yet #1227 carries it (legacy residue the #730 sweep missed, or a second labeling path exists). Verify BOTH: (a) no current rule labels machine PRs validation_failed; (b) a self-clear path exists.

Fix shape: for MACHINE-authored PRs, park-reset (or a sibling) clears validation_failed when the current head's checks are green OR the park predates the last head move — then validate-armed re-validates normally. Guests keep the 2026-09-27 sticky behavior. Regression test: machine PR parked with green head → label cleared within a tick, validation re-armed.

